  "content": "<p>如需Forge版本，请点击此处！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge</a></p><p>FTB Library是FTB模组的核心组件，旨在简化和优化开发者的模组制作体验，提升Feed the Beast生态系统中模组的开发效率。虽然主要供FTB Chunks和FTB Quests等FTB模组使用，但并未明确禁止非FTB模组集成。不过请注意，在此类场景中使用可能遇到挑战，由此产生的任何问题需由模组开发者自行负责。</p><p>查阅我们的文档了解更多FTB Library信息：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-library</a></p><h4><strong>支持与依赖</strong></h4><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-fabric.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-quilt.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>配套模组</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-teams.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-quests.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h3><strong>核心功能</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><strong>简化GUI开发</strong>：FTB Library提供结构化GUI框架，让我们能优化FTB模组套件的用户体验。</li>\n<li><strong>侧边栏系统</strong>：在物品栏屏幕左上角引入便捷侧边栏，快速访问核心功能。</li>\n<li><strong>配置库</strong>：通过内置配置库轻松管理模组配置与设置，定制游戏体验更简单。</li>\n<li><strong>SNBT系统</strong>：包含SNBT（字符串命名二进制标签）系统，简化模组数据存储与操作，确保无缝集成与兼容性。</li>\n<li><strong>基于SNBT的配置系统</strong>：利用SNBT配置系统简化模组配置，快速调整行为与外观。</li>\n<li><strong>NBT编辑器</strong>：通过\"/ftblibrary nbtedit\"命令访问强大NBT编辑器，在可视化GUI中直接修改方块实体、实体或玩家的NBT数据。</li>\n<li><strong>实用指令</strong>：提供\"/ftblibrary night\"和\"/ftblibrary day\"控制游戏时间，\"/ftblibrary rain\"启停降雨等便捷指令。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>示例GUI</strong></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-library/map-gui-preview.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p><strong>可扩展的侧边栏按钮</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>FTB Library允许其他模组通过JSON文件创建侧边栏按钮，增强FTB模组的整体功能与灵活性。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-library/sidebar-preview.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>注意</strong>：虽然FTB Library并非为非FTB模组设计，但未明确禁止使用。选择集成的开发者需做好应对潜在挑战的准备。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>请谨慎使用，并对由此产生的兼容性或集成问题负全责。您可在GitHub问题页面报告漏洞或功能需求。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>支持</h2><ul>\n<li>整合包问题请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>模组问题请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有疑问？加入Discord社区：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>关注动态</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
